<title>USA: Shop at Home enters pact with TCI.</title>
<headline>Shop at Home enters pact with TCI.</headline>
<dateline>KNOXVILLE, Tenn. 1996-08-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shop At Home Inc said on Thursday it has entered an agreement for Tele-Communications Inc to bring the home shopping channel into cable subscribers homes.</p>
<p>Shop At Home programming will be introduced to no fewer than four million Tele-Communications Inc subscriber households by November 1996 for a minimum of six hours each night, seven nights a week, Shop At Home said.</p>
<p>The number of households could grow to as many as 10 million within the first year, the company said.</p>
</text>
